  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">김정식 수석 선생님께서&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">아이디어를 공유해주셔서^^</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">바이브코딩으로 어제 뚝딱 만들어 본</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">연수 서명지 구글시트로 받기(테스트 용)</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzQ81dIJgOK8iXrGBDGSKuq_1c1XUTFdUni20kJutumTOZdr324rNP6WkqC327LftqtRw/exec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzQ81dIJgOK8iXrGBDGSKuq_1c1XUTFdUni20kJutumTOZdr324rNP6WkqC327LftqtRw/exec</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"연수 참여 서명\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"script.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzQ81dIJgOK8iXrGBDGSKuq_1c1XUTFdUni20kJutumTOZdr324rNP6WkqC327LftqtRw/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzQ81dIJgOK8iXrGBDGSKuq_1c1XUTFdUni20kJutumTOZdr324rNP6WkqC327LftqtRw/exec\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzQ81dIJgOK8iXrGBDGSKuq_1c1XUTFdUni20kJutumTOZdr324rNP6WkqC327LftqtRw/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzQ81dIJgOK8iXrGBDGSKuq_1c1XUTFdUni20kJutumTOZdr324rNP6WkqC327LftqtRw/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">연수 참여 서명</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">script.google.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">테스트 해보세요</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">위 링크 들어가시면됩니다</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">관리자 버튼을 누르면</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">연수명 새로 만들어서 새로운 연수 서명이 됩니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">서명 해보시고 확인해보세요</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">그러면 연수 서명 받은 것은</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">아래 시트에 저장 됩니다</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1tVPbBj4YMqiWLLW63yP9J8W_koTzm_syHL7iNPNdTcE/edit?gid=1015994425#gid=1015994425\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1tVPbBj4YMqiWLLW63yP9J8W_koTzm_syHL7iNPNdTcE/edit?gid=1015994425#gid=1015994425</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"연수 사인지\" data-og-description=\"이 브라우저 버전은 더 이상 지원되지 않습니다. 지원되는 브라우저로 업그레이드하세요.\" data-og-host=\"docs.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1tVPbBj4YMqiWLLW63yP9J8W_koTzm_syHL7iNPNdTcE/edit?gid=1015994425#gid=1015994425\" data-og-url=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1tVPbBj4YMqiWLLW63yP9J8W_koTzm_syHL7iNPNdTcE/edit?gid=1015994425&amp;usp=embed_facebook\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/xkm8V/hyZq3ia1Td/t3ikD89w3wsHts1PPdN591/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1tVPbBj4YMqiWLLW63yP9J8W_koTzm_syHL7iNPNdTcE/edit?gid=1015994425#gid=1015994425\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1tVPbBj4YMqiWLLW63yP9J8W_koTzm_syHL7iNPNdTcE/edit?gid=1015994425#gid=1015994425\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/xkm8V/hyZq3ia1Td/t3ikD89w3wsHts1PPdN591/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\" alt=\"\